  <title>Release notes from dynamo</title>
  <updated>2026-10-20T01:00:33Z</updated>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/942206898/v1.6.0-muse-spark-open-dev.1</id>
    <updated>2026-10-20T02:09:56Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/releases/tag/v1.6.0-muse-spark-open-dev.1"/>
    <title>Dynamo v1.6.0-muse-spark-open-dev.1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo v1.6.0-muse-spark-open-dev.1&lt;/strong&gt; is an experimental snapshot build with early &lt;strong&gt;Meta Muse Spark Open&lt;/strong&gt; support on the Dynamo &lt;strong&gt;SGLang&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;TensorRT-LLM&lt;/strong&gt; backends. It is &lt;strong&gt;not recommended for production&lt;/strong&gt; and is not a QA-gated release. APIs, behavior, and defaults may change before stable support. Use it for evaluation, testing, and early feedback only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo v1.6.0-muse-spark-open-dev.1 adds serving for &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;meta-models/Muse-Spark-Open-816B-A42B-NVFP4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; on Dynamo &lt;strong&gt;SGLang&lt;/strong&gt; (recommended), &lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;TensorRT-LLM&lt;/strong&gt;. The frontend gains the &lt;code&gt;muse_spark&lt;/code&gt; reasoning and tool-call parsers, plus Responses API support for native, deferred, and custom tools, commentary streaming, conversation replay, and client tool search. The vLLM and SGLang containers are built on digest-pinned public Muse Spark Open model images (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16700&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kubernetes recipes cover ten GB200 and GB300 targets: six SGLang (aggregated, 1P1D disaggregated, and KV-aware routed), two vLLM aggregated, and two TensorRT-LLM aggregated. All use TP4/EP4 with an FP8 KV cache and a 1M-token context, with shared model-cache manifests and an AIPerf agentic trace benchmark under &lt;code&gt;recipes/muse-spark-open-816b-a42b&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16553&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16553/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16553&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16557&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16557/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16557&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16567&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16567/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16567&lt;/a&gt;, brought onto this branch by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16856&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16856/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16856&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Branch&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Base Commit&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;165d854ba6b18df8f0bebfebe20e7e29b062b1b2&lt;/code&gt; (2026-09-03)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Release Branch&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;release/1.6.0-muse-spark-open-dev.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Release Tip&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;6b9d12ebcd371ced77af980b0ae72e7f0f054c2d&lt;/code&gt; (2026-10-20)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SGLang&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;lmsysorg/sglang:dev-muse-spark-open&lt;/code&gt; (digest-pinned, CUDA 13.0)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;vllm/vllm-openai:muse-spark-open&lt;/code&gt; (digest-pinned, CUDA 13.0)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;TensorRT-LLM&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;1.3.0rc25&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;nvcr.io/nvidia/tensorrt-llm/release&lt;/code&gt;, CUDA 13.1), NIXL v1.3.1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Container Images&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Backend&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Arch&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Image&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;SGLang (CUDA 13.0)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;multi-arch (&lt;code&gt;amd64&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;arm64&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvcr.io/nvidia/ai-dynamo/sglang-runtime:1.6.0-muse-spark-open-dev.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;vLLM (CUDA 13.0)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;multi-arch (&lt;code&gt;amd64&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;arm64&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvcr.io/nvidia/ai-dynamo/vllm-runtime:1.6.0-muse-spark-open-dev.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;TensorRT-LLM (CUDA 13.1)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;arm64&lt;/code&gt; only&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvcr.io/nvidia/ai-dynamo/tensorrtllm-runtime:1.6.0-muse-spark-open-dev.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recipes pin these images by digest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Versions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Backend&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Source&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;CUDA&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;SGLang&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Dynamo-built runtime on &lt;code&gt;lmsysorg/sglang:dev-muse-spark-open@sha256:8cfc5a72cb296771f5f8a4a4688cb6d05685610a830cbb616fa4ab0eb7bb2b0a&lt;/code&gt;, rebaselined on NVIDIA CUDA 13.0.3 for compliance&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;13.0&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;upstream image&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;NIXL from the upstream SGLang image; VP8/VP9-only FFmpeg for Rust media decoding&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;vLLM&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Dynamo-built runtime on &lt;code&gt;vllm/vllm-openai:muse-spark-open@sha256:c91025b5be1039a93ca975d1d44f352b0e770bb6c8b142b5056cf92204ca137c&lt;/code&gt;, rebaselined on NVIDIA CUDA 13.0.3 for compliance&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;13.0&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;3.12&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Keeps the model image&#39;s Transformers stack; vLLM-Omni disabled; NIXL from the upstream vLLM image&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;TensorRT-LLM&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Dynamo-built runtime on &lt;code&gt;nvcr.io/nvidia/tensorrt-llm/release:1.3.0rc25&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;13.1&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;3.12&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;NIXL v1.3.1&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Model&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Precision&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;GPU&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;meta-models/Muse-Spark-Open-816B-A42B-NVFP4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;NVFP4 weights, FP8 KV cache&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;GB200, GB300&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;816B total / 42B active parameters; 1M-token context; TP4/EP4; &lt;code&gt;muse_spark&lt;/code&gt; reasoning and tool-call parsers&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Muse Spark Open&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Muse Spark Open&lt;/strong&gt; is a Meta mixture-of-experts model (816B total parameters, 42B active) published as &lt;code&gt;meta-models/Muse-Spark-Open-816B-A42B-NVFP4&lt;/code&gt; (NVFP4). This build serves it through Dynamo&#39;s SGLang, vLLM, and TensorRT-LLM backends, with aggregated, disaggregated, and KV-aware routed serving on SGLang and aggregated serving on vLLM and TensorRT-LLM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend and Responses API&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Muse Spark Open parsers:&lt;/strong&gt; Added the &lt;code&gt;muse_spark&lt;/code&gt; reasoning and tool-call parsers on the unified parser path. Parser, protocol, and renderer crates are pinned to published versions across the root, Python, and KVBM workspaces, including &lt;code&gt;dynamo-parsers =8.2.0-muse-spark-open-dev.1&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16700&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Native, deferred, and custom tool support, with expanded &lt;code&gt;tool_choice&lt;/code&gt; handling (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16700&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responses API:&lt;/strong&gt; Commentary-phase streaming, conversation history replay, and client-side tool-search handling (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16700&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SGLang Backend&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Muse Spark Open runtime:&lt;/strong&gt; Built on a digest-pinned public SGLang model image, with compatibility fixes for the multimodal encode worker, argument handling, and model registration (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16700&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;vLLM Backend&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Muse Spark Open runtime:&lt;/strong&gt; Built on a digest-pinned public vLLM model image that preserves the model&#39;s dependency combination. vLLM-Omni is disabled for this release and unused InstantTensor is removed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend compatibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixes for the embedding worker, renderer, and KV-event APIs, and an explicit &lt;code&gt;imageio&amp;gt;=2.37.0&lt;/code&gt; requirement for video request processing (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16700&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TensorRT-LLM Backend&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TensorRT-LLM 1.3.0rc25:&lt;/strong&gt; Runtime on the &lt;code&gt;1.3.0rc25&lt;/code&gt; release image with LLM worker updates and unit tests (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16700&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Containers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Stricter license and attribution auditing for the shipped images, including exact Rust/Go binary dependencies, Python environments, and removal of unneeded development packages from the SGLang base. Native &lt;code&gt;amd64&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;arm64&lt;/code&gt; final-image audits are required (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16700&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recipes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Muse Spark Open recipes:&lt;/strong&gt; Added &lt;code&gt;recipes/muse-spark-open-816b-a42b&lt;/code&gt; with shared model-cache PVC and download job, six SGLang targets (aggregated, 1P1D disaggregated with NIXL, and KV-aware routed on GB200 and GB300), two experimental vLLM aggregated targets, and a perf/trace reference (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16553&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16553/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16553&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/tree/6b9d12ebcd371ced77af980b0ae72e7f0f054c2d/recipes/muse-spark-open-816b-a42b&quot;&gt;recipe folder&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/blob/6b9d12ebcd371ced77af980b0ae72e7f0f054c2d/recipes/muse-spark-open-816b-a42b/README.md&quot;&gt;README&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TensorRT-LLM recipes:&lt;/strong&gt; Added experimental aggregated TensorRT-LLM targets for GB200 and GB300 (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16567&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16567/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16567&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Display name:&lt;/strong&gt; Capitalized &quot;Open&quot; in the recipe display name (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16557&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16557/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16557&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Getting Started&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deployment is Kubernetes-based (Dynamo Platform + &lt;code&gt;DynamoGraphDeployment&lt;/code&gt;). Full steps (namespace, Hugging Face token secret, model-cache PVC, model download job, DGD apply, and a &lt;code&gt;/v1/chat/completions&lt;/code&gt; smoke test) are in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/blob/6b9d12ebcd371ced77af980b0ae72e7f0f054c2d/recipes/muse-spark-open-816b-a42b/README.md&quot;&gt;recipe README&lt;/a&gt; and the linked recipe page. Recipes expect a Hugging Face token secret named &lt;code&gt;hf-token-secret&lt;/code&gt; and a ReadWriteMany storage class for the &lt;code&gt;shared-model-cache&lt;/code&gt; PVC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Known Issues / Limitations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experimental snapshot build, not QA-gated; not for production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The vLLM and TensorRT-LLM recipes are experimental and aggregated only. Their results cover the first 500 trace requests and are functional validation, not full-trace benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SGLang disaggregated recipes do not support video requests (the image has no &lt;code&gt;decord2&lt;/code&gt;) or frontend decoding (&lt;code&gt;DYN_SGL_FRONTEND_DECODING=true&lt;/code&gt;) for image or video inputs. Use an aggregated SGLang recipe for video.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disaggregated recipes omit provider-specific networking; configure RDMA for long-context requests. SGLang GB200 recipes and GB300 disaggregated recipes require ComputeDomain with Dynamic Resource Allocation (DRA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The TensorRT-LLM image is &lt;code&gt;arm64&lt;/code&gt; only, matching the GB200 and GB300 recipes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Targets Hopper and Blackwell GPUs. vLLM serving CI on A100 and L4 hardware hit CUDA &lt;code&gt;no kernel image is available&lt;/code&gt; errors, and broader backend serving CI was not fully green at merge of &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5892144709&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/16700&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16700&quot;&gt;#16700&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;</content>
